    {
      "id": "f-cb-array-view",
      "name": "FCbArrayView",
      "category": "CompactBinary",
      "signature": "FCbArrayView()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Array of FCbField[View] that have no names.\nAccessing a field of the array requires iteration. Access by index is not provided because the\ncost of accessing an item by index scales linearly with the index.\nThis type only provides a view into memory and does not perform any memory management itself.\nUse FCbArray to hold a reference to the underlying memory when necessary."
    },
